=== npc ===

<b>Calypso:</b> Wow! Another successful harvest today! Thanks, Luna!

<b>Luna:</b> Don't sweat it, Calypso. Helping you out is always more fun anyways.

<b>Calypso:</b> Oh? Something troubling you?

<b>Luna:</b> Nah... it's a long story. Trivial, really.

<b>Calypso:</b> You know I love listening to your stories! And I'm not going anywhere.

<b>Luna:</b> Well... not much of a story, but recently I've been reminded of my best friend...
<b>Luna:</b> Or at least... I still think we are.
<b>Luna:</b> But lately, it just feels as if we've been living completely different lives...
<b>Luna:</b> Back then, I wouldn't have believed things would end up like this. I thought she'd be a friend for life, <i>joined at the hip</i>...
<b>Luna:</b> But now... it's like we're strangers to each other.

<b>Calypso:</b> I'd never forget you, Luna.
<b>Calypso:</b> I'll always be here for you.

<b>Luna:</b> Thanks, Calypso...

<b>Calypso:</b> No worries! Uncle's Chariot is coming down. Hey, why don't you go out and get some fresh air?

<b>Luna:</b> Okay... I will. Thank you.

-> END